      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"sot-faq\">\n  <div class=\"sot-faq-inner\">\n    <h2 class=\"sot-faq-heading\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n\n    <details class=\"sot-faq-item\" open>\n      <summary>What does S.O.T stand for?</summary>\n      <div class=\"sot-faq-answer\">\n        <p>S.O.T stands for Source of Truth. We're a streetwear brand for the next generation.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"sot-faq-item\">\n      <summary>Is SOT clothing unisex?</summary>\n      <div class=\"sot-faq-answer\">\n        <p>Yes. Our range includes unisex tees, shirts and trousers. You can shop by <a href=\"/collections/unisex-shirts\">tops</a> or <a href=\"/collections/unisex-bottoms\">bottoms</a>.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"sot-faq-item\">\n      <summary>Where are your clothes made?</summary>\n      <div class=\"sot-faq-answer\">\n        <p>Everything we make is 100% made in Pakistan.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"sot-faq-item\">\n      <summary>How is the fit designed?</summary>\n      <div class=\"sot-faq-answer\">\n        <p>Our pieces were engineered over 11 months for a fit that lasts. You can check the available sizes on each product page.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"sot-faq-item\">\n      <summary>Is delivery free?</summary>\n      <div class=\"sot-faq-answer\">\n        <p>Yes, delivery is currently free across all of Pakistan for a limited time.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"sot-faq-item\">\n      <summary>How long will my order take to arrive?</summary>\n      <div class=\"sot-faq-answer\">\n        <p>You can find delivery details in our <a href=\"/pages/shipping-policy\">Shipping Policy</a>.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"sot-faq-item\">\n      <summary>Can I return or exchange an item?</summary>\n      <div class=\"sot-faq-answer\">\n        <p>Please see our <a href=\"/pages/return-and-refund-policy\">Return and Refund Policy</a> for full details.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"sot-faq-item\">\n      <summary>Is a new collection coming?</summary>\n      <div class=\"sot-faq-answer\">\n        <p>Yes. Volume-001 is live now and Volume-002 is on the way. Subscribe to our emails to be the first to know about new collections and exclusive offers.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"sot-faq-item\">\n      <summary>How can I contact you?</summary>\n      <div class=\"sot-faq-answer\">\n        <p>Email us at <a href=\"mailto:support@sotstudio.pk\">support@sotstudio.pk</a> or call <a href=\"tel:03196336294\">0319-6336294</a>.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n.sot-faq {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 48px 16px;\n  background: #f5efe6;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  font-family: inherit;\n}\n\n.sot-faq-inner {\n  max-width: 800px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.sot-faq-heading {\n  margin: 0 0 24px;\n  color: #111111;\n  font-size: 28px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  text-align: center;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.sot-faq-item {\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #d8c3a5;\n}\n\n.sot-faq-item:first-of-type {\n  border-top: 1px solid #d8c3a5;\n}\n\n.sot-faq-item summary {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 16px;\n  padding: 16px 0;\n  color: #111111;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n\n.sot-faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.sot-faq-item summary::after {\n  content: \"+\";\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  color: #111111;\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.sot-faq-item[open] summary::after {\n  content: \"\\2212\";\n}\n\n.sot-faq-answer {\n  padding: 0 32px 16px 0;\n}\n\n.sot-faq-answer p {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: #3d3a35;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n.sot-faq-answer a {\n  color: #111111;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-decoration: underline;\n}\n\n@media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n  .sot-faq {\n    padding: 32px 16px;\n  }\n\n  .sot-faq-heading {\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .sot-faq-item summary {\n    padding: 14px 0;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .sot-faq-answer {\n    padding-right: 0;\n  }\n\n  .sot-faq-answer p {\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n}\n</style>",
